      <rules><rule id="moc-wizard" name="Wizard" hidden="false"><description>A Seer is a Wizard. His required Mark determines whether he uses Chaos, Tchar, Onogal or Shornaal Rituals, or becomes an Arkhar Bloodfather.</description></rule></rules>
